{"step_index":169,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T17:32:07Z","content":"### Complete Implementation & Execution Summary\n\nAll planned improvements, database migrations, real-world tourism API integrations, AI enhancements, and Smart India Hackathon 2025 (Problem 25082 by NATPAC, Government of Kerala) requirements have been implemented and verified.\n\n---\n\n### 1. What Was Completed\n\n1. **Python Database Migration**:\n   * Replaced the Node.js/pg backend with a high-performance **Python FastAPI backend** (`backend/app.py`).\n   * Implemented **Python SQLite3 with Write-Ahead Logging (`WAL`)** (`data/triptrail.db`) with automatic table creation and seed data, while preserving full support for external PostgreSQL instances via `DATABASE_URL`.\n   * Preserved full backward compatibility for `/api/status`, `/api/setup`, `/api/trips`, `/api/query`, and `/api/ai/route`.\n\n2. **Pr